{
"content_id": "765231",
"reference_id": 203374,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Pumziko la sabato ya Mungu",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "pumziko la sabato ya mungu",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wazo la pumziko la sabato la Mungu (kama ilivyoelezwa katika <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004001\" data-end-ref=\"58004011\">Waebrania 4:1–11</data>) limekuwa gumu kwa wasomi wengi kuelewa. Linajumuisha mawazo kutoka kwenye Agano la Kale, kama vile Nchi ya Ahadi kama mahali pa kupumzika kutoka utumwani na kutangatanga. Pia linazungumzia siku ya sabato kama siku ya kupumzika ya kila wiki. Katika <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58003007\" data-end-ref=\"58003019\">Waebrania 3:7–19</data>, mwandishi anarejelea <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19095007\" data-end-ref=\"19095011\">Zaburi 95:7–11</data>. Anatumia mfano wa Waisraeli waliotangatanga nyikani kama mfano wa wale ambao hawakuingia katika pumziko la Mungu kwa sababu hawakutii.</p><p>Je, ni &quot;pumziko&quot; gani ambalo hawakuweza kuingia, ambalo bado linabaki kwa watu wa Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004001\" data-end-ref=\"58004003\">Waebrania 4:1–3</data>)? Mwandishi wa Waebrania alimaanisha zaidi ya ardhi ya kimwili ya Kanaani kama mahali pa &quot;pumziko la sabato&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004008\" data-end-ref=\"58004009\">4:8–9</data>). <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01002002\" data-end-ref=\"01002002\">Mwanzo 2:2</data> inaelezea pumziko la Mungu kama kitu kilichoandaliwa &quot;tangu msingi wa ulimwengu&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004003\" data-end-ref=\"58004004\">Waebrania 4:3–4</data>). Pumziko la Mungu linahusisha kusitisha kazi ya mtu mwenyewe, kama Mungu alivyofanya (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004010\" data-end-ref=\"58004010\">4:10</data>). Wale wanaosikia &quot;sauti Yake,&quot; hawafanyi mioyo yao kuwa migumu, na wanaamini habari njema kuhusu Yesu wanaweza &quot;kuingia katika pumziko hilo&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004001\" data-end-ref=\"58004003\">4:1–3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004007\" data-end-ref=\"58004007\">7</data>).</p><p>Agano la Kale linaita Siku ya Upatanisho “siku ya sabato ya pumziko kamili” (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016029\" data-end-ref=\"03016031\">Mambo ya Walawi 16:29–31</data>). Katika siku hiyo, watu walikomesha kazi zao zote. Katika Agano Jipya, Yesu, Kuhani wetu Mkuu, alitoa dhabihu ya mara moja ambayo ilifanya &quot;kuondoa dhambi&quot; (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58009007\" data-end-ref=\"58009028\">9:7–28</data>). Alikuwa dhabihu ya mwisho ya upatanisho, akileta amani kati ya Mungu na watu. Yesu anawapa watu pumziko la kiroho. Wanaweza kuingia katika pumziko hili kwa kuamini na kutii habari njema hii.</p><p>Pumziko la Mungu kupitia Yesu lina vipengele viwili:</p><ol><li><p>Wale wanaomfuata Yesu wanaacha kujaribu kupata kukubalika kwa Mungu kupitia juhudi zao wenyewe. Wanamwamini kazi iliyokamilika ya Yesu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49002008\" data-end-ref=\"49002009\">Waefeso 2:8–9</data>). Wanapata amani na Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43014027\" data-end-ref=\"43014027\">Yohana 14:27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010036\" data-end-ref=\"44010036\">Matendo 10:36</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45005001\" data-end-ref=\"45005001\">Warumi 5:1</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47005019\" data-end-ref=\"47005021\">2 Wakorintho 5:19–21</data>).</p></li><li><p>Wanatarajia pumziko la milele na furaha katika uwepo wa Mungu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23026019\" data-end-ref=\"23026019\">Isaya 26:19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014013\" data-end-ref=\"66014013\">Ufunuo 14:13</data>). Yesu Kristo anatoa pumziko kamili na bora (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011028\" data-end-ref=\"40011030\">Mathayo 11:28–30</data>).</p></li></ol><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01002001\" data-end-ref=\"01002003\">Mwanzo 2:1–3</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02016021\" data-end-ref=\"02016029\">Kutoka 16:21–29</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02020008\" data-end-ref=\"02020011\">20:8–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02031013\" data-end-ref=\"02031016\">31:13–16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016029\" data-end-ref=\"03016031\">Mambo ya Walawi 16:29–31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23052007\" data-end-ref=\"23052007\">Isaya 52:7</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23054013\" data-end-ref=\"23054014\">54:13–14</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23056002\" data-end-ref=\"23056002\">56:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23056004\" data-end-ref=\"23056004\">4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23057002\" data-end-ref=\"23057002\">57:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23057021\" data-end-ref=\"23057021\">21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23058013\" data-end-ref=\"23058013\">58:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26020020\" data-end-ref=\"26020020\">Ezekieli 20:20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40011028\" data-end-ref=\"40011030\">Mathayo 11:28–30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41002023\" data-end-ref=\"41002028\">Marko 2:23–28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42008048\" data-end-ref=\"42008048\">Luka 8:48</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43014027\" data-end-ref=\"43014027\">Yohana 14:27</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010036\" data-end-ref=\"44010036\">Matendo 10:36</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45005001\" data-end-ref=\"45005001\">Warumi 5:1</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45015013\" data-end-ref=\"45015013\">15:13</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47005019\" data-end-ref=\"47005021\">2 Wakorintho 5:19–21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49002017\" data-end-ref=\"49002017\">Waefeso 2:17</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"51001020\" data-end-ref=\"51001020\">Wakolosai 1:20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"51002016\" data-end-ref=\"51002016\">2:16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"51003015\" data-end-ref=\"51003015\">3:15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004001\" data-end-ref=\"58004011\">Waebrania 4:1–11</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61001002\" data-end-ref=\"61001002\">2 Petro 1:2</data></p>",
